"""
PANEL â€” bot fleet C2 backend (Flask)
=====================================
Tracks every machine running the payload (heartbeat + hashrate), keeps a
command queue that bots pull from, and manages API keys.

Storage:
  - Local:     SQLite file (bots.db) next to this file
  - Vercel/24h: PostgreSQL via DATABASE_URL (Neon/Supabase/Railway) â€” auto-detected

Auth:
  - JWT (HS256) issued at login/register, verified locally on every request â€”
    zero per-request DB lookups for auth. Secret is auto-generated into the
    database (settings table) on first run; JWT_SECRET env overrides it.
  - Legacy X-Admin-Token (master key or session token) still accepted.

Optimizations:
  - Per-request DB connection reuse (one handshake per request, not per query)
  - SQLite WAL mode + busy timeout
  - Slim bot payloads, ETag/304 for pollers, gzip via flask-compress

Env vars (all optional â€” the panel is local-only with no auth):
  DATABASE_URL        Postgres DSN (falls back to SQLite when unset)
  PORT                local port (default 8080)

Run:      python app.py
"""

